  "readings": {
    "current": "ans-spec at 9284c7e as written. AGENT_DEPRECATED is reserved and not emitted (ANS-1 6.3), so deleting the _ans-badge record is the only retirement signal.",
    "proposed": "The change proposed in #77. Not merged. The RA emits AGENT_DEPRECATED, the AHP keeps the _ans-badge record until revocation, and a missing record does not by itself mean retired.",
    "alternative": "Revocation with reason SUPERSEDED followed by DNS cleanup, as #77 comment 6178618043 proposes instead."
  },
