      "id": "A77-11",
      "status": "candidate_against_proposed",
      "reading": "proposed",
      "tests": "Under the proposal the RA has emitted AGENT_DEPRECATED, with certificate arrays, at T0+600. The badge tier reads the new TL status on its next uncached read and accepts with a migration signal. The caller still presents the status token it obtained at T0, which says ACTIVE until T0+3600, so the SCITT tier accepts without the signal. Both tiers admit the caller but report different status until the old token stops being accepted.",
